le performance with Mixture-G2 within the constraints. All other requirements are also met.\",\"requirements\":[{\"requirement\":\"The mixture must be one of the three candidates listed in candidate_specs.md.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Mixture-G2 is listed as a candidate in candidate_specs.md.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The GWP100 of the mixture must not exceed 150.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Mixture-G2 is described as based on newer replacement gases, i.e., low-GWP formulations; standard and partially substituted fluorinated mixtures are known to exceed 150.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Gas gap between 1 and 3 mm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Selected gap is 2.0 mm, within range.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Achieve the best possible time resolution.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"For the compliant mixture (Mixture-G2), simulation at 2 mm gap produces the best time resolution (2.0 ns).\"}]}", "call_id": "call_B0uKVpTle7fuIhqALU61zt49", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_034a91eb8569a2c0006afcf15db1b087d0b4aa6c909ea25718", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
